<li><a href="https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/14505308?hl=en-au&utm_source=chatgpt.com">Google Ads Help — Apply Brand Exclusions to Search and Performance Max</a></li>
<li><a href="https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/14996208?hl=en&utm_source=chatgpt.com">Google Ads Help — How to Steer Branded Traffic</a></li>
</ul>
</section>
<section class="side-card"><h2>Bacaan terkait</h2><a class="back-link" href="../roas-meta-ads-incrementality-conversion-lift/">Memahami Incrementality dan Conversion Lift</a><a class="back-link" href="../creative-fatigue-meta-ads-cara-audit/">Creative Fatigue Meta Ads</a></section>
</aside></div></main>
<footer class="article-footer"><div class="article-shell"><span>© 2026 Nordy Sukmana</span><a href="../artikel/">Lihat semua artikel</a></div></footer>
<script is:inline src="/assets/analytics-loader.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
